SUMMARY:Dog Mic: Stand Up Comedy
DESCRIPTION:A live stand-up comedy open mic featuring amateur comedians from the Waterloo region.A night of stand up comedy. Featuring amateur comedians performing all types of material. If you’ve been wanting to give stand-up comedy a shot this is your chance to sign up. Every Tuesday! No Cover / 19+ Show: 8PM
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/dog-mic-stand-up-comedy/2026-11-24/
LOCATION:Revive Karaoke\, 28B King Street North\, Waterloo\, ON\, N2J 2W7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Arts, Culture, Heritage & Live Performance,Event
