SUMMARY:Christmas at the Castle
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the Victorian era and enjoy the splendour of a Victorian Christmas! November 18th to January 3rd An enchanting\, lavish and magical! Christmas at the Castle is the most wonderful time of the year to visit. Warm yourself in the glow that emanates from every room of the decorated Castle and imagine yourself as a guest of the Livingston family Christmas in 1895. Beginning November 18th\, until January 3rd the Castle will be fully decorated. Wednesday to Sunday 10 a.m. – 3 p.m. Additional Holiday hours: · December 20\, 21\, 22\, 23\, 27\, 28\, 29\, 30 and Jan. 2 & 3
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/christmas-at-the-castle/2026-11-25/
LOCATION:Castle Kilbride\, 60 Snyder's Road West\, Baden\, ON\, N3A 1A1\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Arts, Culture, Heritage & Live Performance,Event
END:VEVENT
