SUMMARY:Euchre Night @ TWB
DESCRIPTION:Euchre Night at TWB Join us for an evening of fun and new friends! – Games begin at 7:00 pm sharp – check in by 6:45 pm. – New to Euchre? Come learn the basics at 6:30 pm! – Individuals welcome – partners are randomly assigned and rotate each round. – $10 in advance | $12 day-of (advance tickets available starting one week prior – get yours early to guarantee your spot!). – Your ticket includes your first 12oz beer (upgrade to a pint or non-beer option at the bar). – Winner takes home a TWB Gift Card!
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/euchre-night-twb-4/
LOCATION:TWB Co-operative Brewing\, 300 Mill St\, Unit 1\, Kitchener\, ON\, Kitchener\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
END:VEVENT
