SUMMARY:Holiday Sip & Shop at St. Jacobs Farmers' Market
DESCRIPTION:Join us for two festive nights at the St. Jacobs Farmers’ Market for our Holiday Sip & Shop event! On Friday\, November 20th and Friday\, November 27th\, all three of our market buildings will be open from 5 PM to 10 PM\, creating the perfect holiday shopping experience.
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/holiday-sip-shop-at-st-jacobs-farmers-market/2026-11-27/
LOCATION:St. Jacobs Farmers’ Market\, 878 Weber Street North  #1\, St. Jacobs\, ON\, N2V 0H2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event,Holiday Events,Shopping
