SUMMARY:Raptors on The Big Screen
DESCRIPTION:We’ll have all of the game day action LIVE on The Big Screen! The largest outdoor screen of its kind in Canada! 📍 64 Grand Ave. S.\, Cambridge\, ON. 📺 FREE outdoor screening! 𝘕𝘰 𝘵𝘪𝘤𝘬𝘦𝘵𝘴 𝘰𝘳 𝘳𝘦𝘴𝘦𝘳𝘷𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘰𝘯𝘴 𝘳𝘦𝘲𝘶𝘪𝘳𝘦𝘥! 🌞 In our outdoor District Square! 🌦️ Rain or shine! 🪑 BYO chairs\, decor\, and team spirit! And of course… 🛜 FREE wifi! 🅿️ FREE parking onsite and nearby!
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/raptors-on-the-big-screen-5/
LOCATION:Gaslight District\, 64 Grand Ave. S\, Cambridge\, ON\, N1S 0B7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
